## Input

```mlk
// An import: a path of the project, the names taken from it, and the name each of them is
// brought in under. A group is how several names are taken from one path at once, and what
// stands inside a group is read inside the path before it.

module project::app

use std::core::Int

use std::core::Int as Integer

use std::{collections::{Map, Set}, prelude::{self, Int, String}}

use std::core::{self as core}

pub use project::types::{self, Handle}

// An import that takes nothing: the group of it is empty, and the path brings in no name.
use project::{}

```

